{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30339","headline":"九日陪越州元相燕龟山寺 · 赵嘏","name":"九日陪越州元相燕龟山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳晨何处泛花游，丞相筵开水上头。\n双影斾摇山雨霁，一声歌动寺云秋。\n林光静带高城晚，湖色寒分半槛流。\n共贺万家逢此节，可怜风物似荆州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}